+Unreleased
+^^^^^^^^^^
+
+- ``JSONStorage`` now writes keys sorted by default to keep files diff-friendly.
+  Pass ``sort_keys=False`` to keep insertion order. Dicts with mixed key types
+  (e.g. ``int`` and ``str``) are sorted by their string form.
+
